    "questionText": "A curve has equation \\( y = 2\\cot\\!\\left(2x - \\tfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right) + 1 \\). (a) Find the period of the curve and the equations of all its vertical asymptotes on the interval \\( [0, \\pi] \\). (b) State the range of the function. (c) Hence solve \\( 2\\cot\\!\\left(2x - \\tfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right) + 1 = 1 \\) for \\( x \\in [0, \\pi] \\), giving your answers as exact multiples of \\( \\pi \\).",
