          "stepNumber": 1,
          "description": "Identify the inner coefficient of x.",
          "workingLatex": "y = 2\\cot(2x - \\tfrac{\\pi}{3}) + 1, \\quad b = 2",
          "explanation": "The horizontal stretch is governed by the multiplier of x inside the cot. Here that multiplier is b = 2, which will compress the standard cot graph. The constants 2 (outside) and +1 do not affect the period."
