          "stepNumber": 3,
          "description": "Write the period formula.",
          "workingLatex": "\\text{new period} = \\frac{2\\pi}{b}",
          "explanation": "For any function f(bx), one full cycle is completed in 1/b of the original length. We substitute b = 2 next."
