      "finalAnswer": "(a) \\(\\sec(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}-x)=\\tfrac{1}{\\cos(\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}-x)}=\\tfrac{1}{\\sin x}=\\csc x\\). (b) \\(y=2\\csc x-1\\); asymptote \\(x=\\pi\\); range \\(y\\le -3\\) or \\(y\\ge 1\\). (c) \\(0\\) crossings (since \\(y=0\\) lies in the excluded band \\(-3<y<1\\)).",
