          "workingLatex": "",
          "explanation": "Draw the three asymptotes \\(x=0,\\tfrac{\\pi}{2},\\pi\\), mark the zeros at \\(\\tfrac{\\pi}{4},\\tfrac{3\\pi}{4}\\), and draw two identical decreasing branches between them.",
