      "finalAnswer": "(a) Minimum \\(f=7\\) at \\(x=\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\). (b) Range \\(f(x)\\ge 7\\), i.e. \\([7,\\infty)\\). (c) \\(x=\\tfrac{\\pi}{6}\\) or \\(x=\\tfrac{5\\pi}{6}\\).",
