          "stepNumber": 4,
          "description": "State the monotonic behaviour.",
          "workingLatex": "\\cot x\\ \\text{decreasing on}\\ \\left(0,\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)",
          "explanation": "\\cot x falls steadily from +\\infty toward 0 across the interval with no turning points. Continuity then guarantees it takes every value in between.",
