          "stepNumber": 6,
          "description": "Confirm this point is a minimum",
          "workingLatex": "|\\csc x| \\ge 1 \\text{ on } (0,\\pi)",
          "explanation": "On (0,\\pi), \\sin x is positive and at most 1, so \\csc x\\ge 1 with equality at the peak of sine, x=\\tfrac{\\pi}{2}. Thus (\\tfrac{\\pi}{2},1) is indeed the minimum of this branch, not a maximum.",
