      "finalAnswer": "(a) Third quadrant: \\(\\cos x<0,\\ \\tan x>0\\). (b) \\(\\sec x=-\\tfrac{13}{12},\\ \\csc x=-\\tfrac{13}{5},\\ \\cot x=\\tfrac{12}{5}\\). (c) \\(1+\\left(\\tfrac{12}{5}\\right)^2=\\tfrac{169}{25}=\\left(\\tfrac{13}{5}\\right)^2\\), identity verified.",
