          "stepNumber": 6,
          "description": "Simplify the fraction.",
          "workingLatex": "\\frac{1}{1} = 1",
          "explanation": "Dividing 1 by 1 gives 1, so the curve has height 1 above the x-axis when x=0. This is the lowest point of this branch, since \\sec always satisfies |y|\\ge 1.",
