          "stepNumber": 6,
          "description": "Evaluate the exact cosine value.",
          "workingLatex": "\\cos\\!\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right) = \\tfrac{1}{2}",
          "explanation": "From the standard exact values, \\cos\\tfrac{\\pi}{3} = \\tfrac{1}{2} (this is the 60-degree value). Knowing the exact-value triangles avoids needing a calculator here."
